#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS IPC Bus Engine
#  File: ipc_bus_engine.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS IPC bus responsible for:
#      • channel registration
#      • async message routing
#      • request/response IPC
#      • broadcast messaging
#      • IPC telemetry
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Channel Registration](ca://s?q=Explain_IPC_Channel_Registration)
#    - [Message Routing](ca://s?q=Explain_IPC_Message_Routing)
#    - [Async Dispatch](ca://s?q=Explain_IPC_Async_Dispatch)
#    - [Broadcast Messaging](ca://s?q=Explain_IPC_Broadcast_Messaging)
#    - [IPC Telemetry](ca://s?q=Explain_IPC_Telemetry)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - register_channel(name, handler)
#         Creates IPC channel.
#
#    - send(channel, payload)
#         Sends message to channel.
#
#    - broadcast(payload)
#         Sends message to all channels.
#
#    - remove_channel(name)
#         Removes IPC channel.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns IPC bus state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  CHANNEL STRUCTURE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "id": "CHN-XXXX",
#      "name": "system.events",
#      "handler": <async callable>,
#      "timestamp": <epoch>
#    }
#
#===============================================================================
#  RELATED MODULES:
